Third-party assets (NOT covered by the MIT licence above)

The MIT licence above applies to the source code in this repository (`src/`,
`index.html`, config files). Binary assets under `public/` belong to their
respective authors:

- `public/models/kenney_city-kit-commercial/` - "City Kit Commercial (2.1)" by
  Kenney (www.kenney.nl), released under CC0 1.0, see the bundled `License.txt`.
- `public/textures/polyhaven/` - PBR textures from Poly Haven (polyhaven.com),
  normally CC0; asset ids are listed in `public/textures/polyhaven/SOURCES.md`.
- `public/hdri/daytime.hdr`, `public/hdri/sunset.hdr` - environment HDRIs whose
  original source is not recorded yet (see `public/hdri/SOURCES.md`); verify the
  licence before redistributing.
